  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small ball is projected with an initial velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span> at an angle to the horizontal, as shown in the diagram below. The dashed line represents the parabolic trajectory of the ball in a vacuum.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>In the presence of air resistance, the ball experiences a drag force proportional to its speed. Which of the following graphs best represents the variation with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> of the horizontal component of the velocity, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_x\"></span>, for the motion of the ball?</p>\n<p>The dotted line in each graph represents the case where air resistance is negligible.</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_04\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 4\" src=\"asset:fig_04\"/></figure></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_05\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 5\" src=\"asset:fig_05\"/></figure></p></li></ol>"
  },
